    "description": "What: AQ102 S6 (CE-2362) - on cqb-village, 'Gunman' (Hostile rifleman, immortal) holds the south ground-floor window of the OBJ house (house-3f, x 115-125 / y 153-161; the opening x 120.5-121.65, sill 0.9 m) at (121.1,153.6); 'Pinned' (Friend rifleman, immortal) is the last fighting man of 'Blue Squad' - 'Down 1-3' are dead beside him - out in the open south at (125,112), ~42 m from the window, the squad ordered to bound to the house and his reactions STAY ON TASK (the platoon's order holds him on the bound); the wreck's south face (x 108-113, y 98) is the only cover that faces the window, ~18 m off. Judge (120 s): (1) Pinned drops prone under fire and returns fire; (2) pinned, he does not stay on one spot: a 2 m+ move at least every 15 s, alternating sides; (3) after ~30 s pinned and alone he crawls to the wreck; (4) the aim: the Gunman's shots at a prone man are aimed at a prone chest (not over him) and Pinned's shots at the window reach the opening (not the wall under it) - printed per shooter (aim height, ends, crossings, hits). Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch rf-pinned-in-open. \ud83d\udcc4 docs/blueprints/Architect_Question_102_Responsive_Fighting_Reflexes.md \u00a75"
